%TunnelDesc%=CmF.Dev,PCI\VEN_8086&DEV_A72F&CC_0604
; PLACEHOLDER: the emulator's stand-in tunnel bridges, if they need an id
; of their own (task 39-0.7's reading); every line must carry &CC_0604.

[CmFilterModels.NTx86.6.0]
