%TunnelDesc%=CmF.Dev6,PCI\VEN_8086&DEV_1136&CC_0604
; The integrated controllers' tunnel root ports (Ice Lake to Raptor Lake),
; untested; the filter acts only on ports the NHI verifies and assigns.
%TunnelDesc%=CmF.Dev6,PCI\VEN_8086&DEV_8A1D&CC_0604
%TunnelDesc%=CmF.Dev6,PCI\VEN_8086&DEV_8A1F&CC_0604
